[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Whole circular rims rounded with a radius that closes a cap to a pole or takes every face away (mitcad#2582, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#741; OCCT port patch 2582), the reporter's three designs made from commands: a cylinder 10 across and 10 high (Body1 F2.b0) whose top rim is rounded with 5 (Fillet1 F3: a hemisphere), then the face at its other end with 5 (Fillet2 F4, a face set: a ball); an annulus 40 across with a bore of 20, 10 high (Body2 F6.b0) whose four rims are rounded with 5 by one fillet (Fillet3 F7: a torus). Each was built 0.1 % smaller with a warning that it leaves a sliver of a face; now at its size, one valid closed solid without a note."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "volume": 785.3981633974483}},

  {"comment": "The top rim rounded with 5: the hemisphere about (0, 0, 5) on the cylinder's lower half, 250 pi - 125 / 3 pi; the top face gone, the bottom a whole disc."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0", "edges": ["E{F2:end(r{c1})|F2:side(c1)}"], "radius": 5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 654.4984694978736,
    "area": 392.69908169872417, "faces": 3, "min_face_area": 1, "tolerance": 1e-8}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F3"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F2.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "sphere"},
    "result": {"total": 1, "faces": [{"surface": "sphere", "center": [0, 0, 5], "radius": 5, "area": 157.07963267948966}]},
    "tolerance": 1e-7}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F2.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "cylinder"},
    "result": {"total": 1, "faces": [{"surface": "cylinder", "radius": 5, "area": 157.07963267948966,
      "bbox": {"min": [-5, -5, 0], "max": [5, 5, 5]}}]}, "tolerance": 1e-7}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F2.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "plane"},
    "result": {"total": 1, "faces": [{"surface": "plane", "normal": [0, 0, -1], "area": 78.53981633974483}]},
    "tolerance": 1e-7}},

  {"comment": "The face at the other end (its saved name F2:start(r{c1}), the bottom disc) rounded with 5: a ball of 5 about (0, 0, 5), 500 / 3 pi, one spherical face and nothing else (the two hemispheres of one sphere are one face)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0",
    "sets": [{"faces": ["F2:start(r{c1})"], "size": {"type": "constant", "radius": 5}}]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet2", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 523.5987755982989,
    "area": 314.1592653589793, "faces": 1, "min_face_area": 1, "tolerance": 1e-8}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F4"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F2.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "sphere"},
    "result": {"total": 1, "faces": [{"surface": "sphere", "center": [0, 0, 5], "radius": 5, "area": 314.1592653589793}]},
    "tolerance": 1e-7}},

  {"comment": "Fillet1 edited to 4 and back to 5, both features recomputed each time: the saved face set of Fillet2 still finds the bottom disc, and the ball comes back."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F3", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0", "edges": ["E{F2:end(r{c1})|F2:side(c1)}"], "radius": 4}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F3", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0", "edges": ["E{F2:end(r{c1})|F2:side(c1)}"], "radius": 5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet2", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 523.5987755982989, "faces": 1, "tolerance": 1e-8}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F4"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},

  {"comment": "The annulus: the ring region r{c1} (the circle of 20, c3, its hole; c2 is the first circle's centre point), extruded 10."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [60, 0], "diameter": 40},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F5", "center": [60, 0], "diameter": 20},
  {"expect": {"sketch": "F5", "regions": ["r{c1}", "r{c3}"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body2", "volume": 9424.77796076938}},

  {"comment": "All four rims rounded with 5 in one set: a torus about the ring's axis, its tube circle of radius 15 at z = 5, its section 5; 2 pi^2 15 25 = 750 pi^2, its area 300 pi^2. No planar or cylindrical face left."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F6.b0",
    "edges": ["E{F6:end(r{c1})|F6:side(c1)}", "E{F6:side(c1)|F6:start(r{c1})}",
              "E{F6:side(c3)|F6:start(r{c1})}", "E{F6:end(r{c1})|F6:side(c3)}"], "radius": 5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet3", "status": "ok", "body": "Body2", "volume": 7402.203300817607,
    "area": 2960.881320326, "faces": 4, "min_face_area": 1, "tolerance": 1e-8}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F7"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F6.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "torus"},
    "result": {"total": 4}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F6.b0", "geometry": true},
    "none": {"surface": "plane"}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F6.b0", "geometry": true},
    "none": {"surface": "cylinder"}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "faces", "body": "F6.b0", "geometry": true, "surface": "torus"},
    "result": {"faces": [{"center": [60, 0, 5], "major_radius": 15, "minor_radius": 5},
                         {"center": [60, 0, 5], "major_radius": 15, "minor_radius": 5},
                         {"center": [60, 0, 5], "major_radius": 15, "minor_radius": 5},
                         {"center": [60, 0, 5], "major_radius": 15, "minor_radius": 5}]}, "tolerance": 1e-7}}
]
